  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e95750f108e433543aef0099027763ad, type: 3}
  m_Name: PostBossFight
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryLines:
  - text: "No vid\xED\u0161, j\xE1 jsem ti v\u017Edycky \u0159\xEDkal, \u017Ee s
      bran\xEDkem v ruce dok\xE1\u017Ee\u0161 velk\xE9 v\u011Bci! "
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "A hele, vypadly z n\xED l\xE9\u010Div\xE9 plechovky, ty m\u016F\u017Ee\u0161
      pou\u017E\xEDt kl\xE1vesou Q a dopln\xED ti \u010D\xE1st \u017Eivot\u016F."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "Pfff, ty te\u010F nepot\u0159ebuju. Radost z v\xEDt\u011Bzstv\xED m\u011B
      te\u010Fka \xFApln\u011B nab\xEDj\xED!"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "To v\xED\u0161 \u017Ee jo, tak a\u017E bude\u0161 nab\xEDt\xE1 tak za
      mnou p\u0159ij\u010F a\u0165 odtud m\u016F\u017Eeme vypadnout. A ty plechovky
      si nech, t\u0159eba se ti n\u011Bkdy budou hodit."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  choices: []
